  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender workshop for partner gender focal points</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GESD is the Kenyan partner assigned to provide gender related support to the Kenyan church partners within the wider programme &apos;promoting gender with church partners&apos;. This workshop is a training of trainers for gender focal persons in the five dioceses of Maralal, Marsabit, Isiolo, Mombasa and Kitui. GESD is also envisioning the participation of selected community mobilisers as they will be working closely with the gender focal points. The workshop will last two days ir order to have more in-depth discussions of the key gender issues. GESD in the spirit of sustainability will call for some facilitators from the locality of Isiolo; specifically the County Gender officer and human rights expert to share on key gender and human rights issues.</narrative>
  </description>
